cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the archived ShorelineDT release."
title: "ShorelineDT"
abstract: >-
  A reduced GAMA and Python demonstration of a schema-checked interface that
  maps synthetic ensemble shoreline states to DBVR, probability-of-exceedance,
  and intervention classes. Case-study data and manuscript sources are not
  distributed in this release.
type: software
